cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NN-DK, please cite this software and the research papers relevant to your experiment."
type: software
title: "NN-DK: Neural Dean–Kawasaki Dynamics and Statistics"
authors:
  - family-names: Ji
    given-names: Xiaohao
repository-code: "https://github.com/xrough/nn-dk"
url: "https://github.com/xrough/nn-dk"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible neural numerical experiments for Dean–Kawasaki dynamics and
  coarse particle systems, including conservative finite-volume references,
  causal density-path solvers, and conditional statistics models with
  explicit numerical targets and uncertainty diagnostics.
keywords:
  - Dean-Kawasaki
  - stochastic partial differential equations
  - interacting particles
  - neural numerical methods
  - uncertainty quantification
